Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：终于开始了决斗狂欢节决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗过山车！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坐着过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决斗 还是头一回啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙 是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三人一组来盯上我了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然召唤出怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）而且还一口气召唤了3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）突然就变成了3对1的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）哎呀 从最后一名
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猛追上来的九十九选手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等待着他的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在预选赛中也以出众的团队配合为武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一路赢上来的 坠落小子们。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们早已召唤出了怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，不容错过的决斗要开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心在燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）别输啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）猫咪万岁！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）真期待呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些赏金猎人会怎么料理游马呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沃尔夫：那个叫九十九游马的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鬼，干掉就行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）报酬随你们开。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（杰克尔）这不是挺不错的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（科约特）就这么定了，大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}契约成立。就按你们希望的把他干掉，绝对干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）不过，光是干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可没意思啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿，看招。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 前后都是敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今只能打了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我帝王 攻击前面的巫师！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 干掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是高兴的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看 那些家伙的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们坠落者操纵的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁石怪兽的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间 名字带有磁石的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会提升４００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的战斗 现在才开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巫师 攻击我我我帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同归于尽？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的雄鹰的攻击力提升到了２０００。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，第一场战斗就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因效果提升的攻击力，会恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦，结结实实地挨了一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的实力不止这点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点，让我看看那份力量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）对没有 No.卡的人，我没什么好说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，逆转爆破！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆，Ｖ，你们这些家伙我绝对会亲手解决掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德鲁瓦）快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别太勉强自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边也好这边也好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激烈的战斗正在不断展开。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但此时此刻　最燃的　果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九选手和Fall Guys。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟九十九选手会　就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沦为盘中餐吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧吧！　Heart Burning！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要　召唤磁铁·金刚·伊普西龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁铁·鳄鱼·泽塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下　又被怪兽包围了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　就算在战斗中被破坏…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的怪兽攻击力也只会提升而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔　该怎么办…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　用手牌里的隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的隆隆隆石人　1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！　挡下那些家伙的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那一瞬间切换车道的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 咯咯咯咯莱姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 第二场战斗开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鳄鱼·泽塔 攻击咯咯咯咯莱姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鳄鱼攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:06:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好！咯咯咯咯莱姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}金刚·伊普西龙 攻击咯咯咯咯莱姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}金刚拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在！在受到第三只的攻击之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切换车道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事 我早就看穿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 郊狼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？车道被堵住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是糖豆人的团队配合。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的生命值还剩1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的鹰·德尔塔的攻击力是1200。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次直接攻击要是成功的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能履行和特隆的约定……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这笔巨款就是我们的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…可恶 该怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.77,0:07:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 磁铁鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马直接攻…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是什么鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你是谁啊到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）三打一也太卑鄙了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来帮你 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么会在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释待会儿再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之先把这家伙干掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧～ 火箭箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力5000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥 这里交给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 安娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 你不是没参加
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意那些细节。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是男人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明谁都没有攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爆走特急火箭·箭在战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须将5张手牌送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}否则就会自爆。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 重要的东西别给我忘了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…… 嘛 细节什么的就别在意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 叽叽歪歪烦不烦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 磁铁·重生！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付500生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地唤回鳄鱼·泽塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！鳄鱼·泽塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快逃！安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个碍眼的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先把你给收拾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！是抽卡通道。抽卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 勇气机车 勇敢波波。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.49,0:10:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 磁力融合！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鹰·德尔塔 鳄鱼·泽塔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放 金刚·伊普西龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 超电磁龙 磁龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 ３５００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！安娜她…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！这次轮到我来救她了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 蓝刃者！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 安娜！现在 我就换车道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会让你换车道。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点。还有下一个分歧点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易。抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤磁铁·巴多尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！我召唤磁铁·干扰者。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁铁龙 攻击勇气波波！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁铁地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（沃尔夫）磁铁龙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏怪兽的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将那个攻击力份的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！这样下去的话 安娜会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 前后都被堵住了的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 只能强行撬开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 蓝刃剑士！攻击巴多尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这个瞬间 巴多尔的效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家 ２００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 磁铁·重生。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付500点生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地唤回巴多尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，不管多少次都放马过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你的生命值一点点削光。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是这么反复来上几次你的生命值也会变成0……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可是一个团队的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算我和杰克的生命值都耗尽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要狼哥还在……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要干掉你，大把的钱就到手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大把的钱！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的目标可不是夺冠。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们接了用钱干掉你的活儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉我，到底是谁，干这种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（狼）谁知道呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《现在 能召唤的只有这家伙吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}豪腕特急 特罗科洛科保护我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力 1000吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度可防不住我的磁石龙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上 蓝刃龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.64,0:13:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击巴多尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎也没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的阵型绝对不可能被攻破。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的同伴由狼大哥来收拾。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 不想想办法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去 我和安娜都会！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这种状况下…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}致命一击～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）太没劲了啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用英雄挑战者·斯巴达斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击磁力干扰者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁力干扰者 怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方的怪兽返回手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧… 真是不服输的劲头啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马这家伙我来对付！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太感谢了！ 欠你个人情！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那笔账我来还 安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 蓝刃龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！ 攻击力1600的蓝刃龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想打赢3500的磁石龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为可能吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓝刃龙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把战斗伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能破坏对方怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别多管闲事！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会被那种家伙干掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！明明人家帮了你……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先出手帮忙的是我这边才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，谢了，安娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！啊……不……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我又不是想被夸……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明高兴得不得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（狼）竟敢小看我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把九十九游马打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先，把蓝刃龙者的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终阵型！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤磁石变色龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁石变色龙集齐2只的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的效果将会无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那蓝刃的效果也到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤英雄挑战者·额外剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会让你们对游马出手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（狼）郊狼！可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别想跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！那家伙是我的对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我也来助你一臂之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞不懂啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算3个人一起上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能战斗的只有1个人吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，如果在同一条赛道上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许可以。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的不乱剑士　安娜的托洛克洛克{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}权现坂的额外剑　都是等级４。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的怪兽凑齐３只的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。　现在正是　万众一心之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　等级４的不乱剑士和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜的托洛克洛克
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}权现坂的额外剑进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　独眼技能·获取者！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力２５００？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！　那样的话　可敌不过攻击力３５００的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁石龙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}额外剑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在成为叠放单元时　拥有让攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升１０００点的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的托洛克洛可也有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升８００点攻击力的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？攻击力４３００！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这是怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！而且，我还要发动技能·增益者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归为己有！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要夺取磁石龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的磁石龙的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的怪兽攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗受到８００点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上３５００的效果伤害的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就会被一回合杀……输掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.56,0:18:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们同伴的羁绊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会让大哥得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}豺狼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别想逃！站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了。我们已经赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。靠大家的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这真是漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集结了同伴的力量九十九选手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}击退了Fall Guys的三人组！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）干得好啊乌拉！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！好棒！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（沃尔夫）可恶…可恶…可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饶不了那群家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）哎？那你是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是决赛大会的晋级者吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）啊…嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，什么气氛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把进入决赛大会的某个人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绑起来 然后替换掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做跟德之助一样的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也是没办法的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为……我想见你啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……什么？那是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁铁龙……那家伙 又回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胡狼 郊狼的仇就让我来报吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 不妙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:20:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 直接磁铁。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付一半生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看招～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤工作列车 信号红。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}信号红
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在敌人进行直接攻击的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以强制进行战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.14,0:20:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那小丫头 又来碍事！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此就是货真价实的直接攻击了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 技能·增益者！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗败者已从赛道上排除。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）干得漂亮 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你 安娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.99,0:21:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.69,0:21:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别输了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦。 绝对要夺冠啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 气氛挺不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}友情　羁绊…　原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是　九十九游马的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激烈的战斗接连展开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.15,0:21:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}公园区域也　到此结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突破这里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将冲入下一个难关　地下区域！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干就完了！　绝对要赢！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊　我！

